WEBVTT

01:35.720 --> 01:40.850
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.400 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 35]

01:56.759 --> 01:57.530
Your Highness,

01:57.530 --> 01:58.710
the Imperial Guards are here.

01:58.710 --> 01:59.770
Quite a few of them.

02:00.350 --> 02:02.230
It must be the Murong family's doing.

02:02.230 --> 02:03.070
Your Highness,

02:03.070 --> 02:04.350
take Miss Yixiao and leave first.

02:04.350 --> 02:05.220
We'll take care of them.

02:05.220 --> 02:05.980
Stay calm.

02:06.350 --> 02:07.360
They came prepared.

02:07.360 --> 02:08.620
We mustn't act rashly.

02:09.150 --> 02:10.050
They outnumber us.

02:10.050 --> 02:11.280
We can't fight them head-on.

02:11.280 --> 02:12.150
Let's retreat for now.

02:12.150 --> 02:12.760
Follow me.

02:13.280 --> 02:13.690
But...

02:27.030 --> 02:27.670
This way.

02:28.870 --> 02:29.380
Search!

02:29.630 --> 02:30.140
Yes!

02:34.030 --> 02:34.560
Let's go.

02:48.560 --> 02:49.240
Anyone there?

02:49.240 --> 02:50.240
-No.
-No.

02:53.750 --> 02:54.420
General,

02:54.680 --> 02:55.480
no one inside.

02:55.870 --> 02:58.130
General, no one behind the house either.

03:04.150 --> 03:04.620
Come on.

03:29.190 --> 03:31.010
Murong Jie!

03:35.190 --> 03:35.750
Attack!

03:47.000 --> 03:47.700
Go report to General.

03:47.700 --> 03:48.240
Yes.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.480
This strike...

04:32.110 --> 04:35.000
Is for Gu Yu!

04:42.150 --> 04:43.310
This strike

04:43.340 --> 04:44.780
is for Hound!

04:53.340 --> 04:54.560
This strike...

04:55.630 --> 04:59.240
Is for all our fallen brothers!

05:06.680 --> 05:09.480
Kill!

05:29.750 --> 05:30.360
Lu Ke.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.159
We can't delay any longer.

05:34.159 --> 05:34.890
Retreat now.

05:35.000 --> 05:35.530
Let's go.

06:06.920 --> 06:07.750
Keep chasing them!

06:07.750 --> 06:08.110
Yes!

06:08.430 --> 06:08.960
Let's go!

06:09.360 --> 06:10.010
Yes!

06:15.830 --> 06:16.690
Your Highness,

06:17.040 --> 06:18.300
what should we do next?

06:22.160 --> 06:23.560
Go to the Feng Battalion.

06:23.560 --> 06:24.420
Your Highness,

06:24.510 --> 06:25.650
I told you before

06:25.720 --> 06:26.240
that in the Feng Battalion,

06:26.240 --> 06:27.310
those who refused to submit to Murong Yao

06:27.310 --> 06:28.830
have all been killed by him.

06:28.830 --> 06:29.480
The Feng Battalion

06:29.480 --> 06:30.830
is no longer what it used to be.

06:30.830 --> 06:33.630
It would be dangerous for you to go there
like this.

06:33.630 --> 06:35.159
Our men have fought through life and death

06:35.159 --> 06:36.510
alongside me for so many years.

06:36.510 --> 06:38.270
I don't believe they would betray me.

06:38.270 --> 06:39.920
They only submitted to Murong Yao

06:39.920 --> 06:41.380
by force of circumstance.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.560
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

06:43.560 --> 06:44.830
and never fail the people.

06:44.830 --> 06:46.790
This is the shared belief of all our men.

06:46.790 --> 06:48.430
This will never change.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.180
The Feng Battalion

06:50.800 --> 06:52.730
will always be the Feng Battalion.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.510
You personally told me back then

06:58.510 --> 06:59.909
that Feng Suige was dead,

06:59.950 --> 07:02.030
and now you're telling me
he's still alive?

07:02.030 --> 07:03.880
I killed him with my own hands,

07:04.480 --> 07:05.250
and his body

07:05.390 --> 07:07.050
was buried by Yao personally.

07:07.620 --> 07:09.040
I cannot figure out

07:09.720 --> 07:11.040
how he survived.

07:12.650 --> 07:14.510
Could it be that
Ling Feng went to save him?

07:14.510 --> 07:16.310
It doesn't matter who saved him!

07:16.600 --> 07:17.560
What matters is that he's still alive

07:17.560 --> 07:18.490
and he's back!

07:18.720 --> 07:20.610
He's back for revenge.

07:22.070 --> 07:22.870
Your Majesty,

07:23.630 --> 07:24.680
please calm down.

07:24.750 --> 07:26.350
How can I possibly calm down?

07:26.870 --> 07:28.920
Back then, you asked me to save your son.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.310
I made him a commandery prince

07:30.310 --> 07:32.510
and even put the Imperial Guards
under his command.

07:32.510 --> 07:33.720
Your Murong family

07:33.720 --> 07:35.250
has gained so much already.

07:35.390 --> 07:37.190
But what have you done in return?

07:37.480 --> 07:39.990
A Feng Suige who has lost everything

07:40.360 --> 07:42.960
is enough to make Your Majesty
panic like this?

07:43.680 --> 07:45.010
If I could kill him once,

07:46.000 --> 07:47.720
I can do it again.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.480
But you've already made me

07:49.480 --> 07:50.810
trust you wrongly once.

07:52.070 --> 07:53.270
Feng Suige

07:53.360 --> 07:54.890
hasn't even made a move yet,

07:55.320 --> 07:56.480
and Your Majesty is already

07:56.480 --> 07:58.270
trying to settle scores with me?

07:58.270 --> 08:00.870
It hasn't been long
since Feng Pingcheng died,

08:01.600 --> 08:02.920
and you've already forgotten

08:02.920 --> 08:04.850
how I helped you settle matters

08:04.950 --> 08:06.080
and put your son

08:06.190 --> 08:07.480
on the throne?

08:07.560 --> 08:09.040
You're threatening me again.

08:09.040 --> 08:10.170
This isn't a threat.

08:10.600 --> 08:11.560
It's a reminder,

08:12.000 --> 08:13.270
reminding Your Majesty

08:13.270 --> 08:14.730
not to forget that you said

08:15.160 --> 08:16.890
the Zhuang and Murong families

08:17.270 --> 08:18.800
would forever be bound together,

08:18.800 --> 08:20.070
sharing weal and woe.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.870
Then I must also remind you

08:26.870 --> 08:28.040
that the one

08:28.040 --> 08:31.570
who branded Feng Suige
with the crime of regicide and patricide

08:31.720 --> 08:32.870
was you.

08:33.950 --> 08:35.750
You're truly battle-hardened.

08:36.270 --> 08:38.270
You really know
how to keep your composure.

08:38.270 --> 08:39.820
When Feng Suige returns,

08:40.270 --> 08:42.030
the truth will be revealed.

08:42.789 --> 08:44.750
Given the situation,
you're still not worried,

08:44.750 --> 08:46.320
so why should I be?

08:49.870 --> 08:50.670
Very well.

08:52.150 --> 08:54.030
Now that everything's out in the open,

08:54.030 --> 08:56.120
it'll actually be easier for us
to handle things.

08:56.120 --> 08:56.970
You and I

08:57.240 --> 08:58.600
no longer have to pretend

08:58.600 --> 08:59.720
to get along.

09:01.320 --> 09:03.320
The closeness between our two families

09:03.320 --> 09:04.670
may be a facade,

09:05.080 --> 09:06.840
but the fact that we share weal and woe

09:06.840 --> 09:07.840
is true.

09:09.390 --> 09:10.920
As long as Feng Suige lives,

09:11.240 --> 09:12.900
neither of us will know peace.

09:15.270 --> 09:16.480
If Feng Suige

09:16.600 --> 09:18.030
wants to turn things around,

09:18.030 --> 09:19.720
he has only two paths to take:

09:20.000 --> 09:20.660
the first is

09:21.270 --> 09:21.840
to return now

09:21.840 --> 09:23.630
and regain control of the Feng Battalion.

09:23.630 --> 09:25.830
Your Majesty need not worry about this.

09:25.840 --> 09:27.270
I can take care of it.

09:28.480 --> 09:29.610
But this second path

09:30.240 --> 09:31.570
concerns His Majesty the Emperor...

09:31.570 --> 09:33.030
Chengyang won't help him.

09:33.240 --> 09:34.270
I'm his mother.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.980
Your Majesty is so confident.

09:38.200 --> 09:38.960
How many lies

09:39.510 --> 09:41.450
did you tell His Majesty?

09:41.550 --> 09:43.550
And how many of those lies did he buy?

09:44.360 --> 09:45.330
Do you know

09:45.550 --> 09:47.390
that His Majesty left the palace
last night

09:47.390 --> 09:49.240
to see Feng Suige?

09:50.320 --> 09:51.120
Did he

09:51.240 --> 09:52.670
tell you about that?

09:54.790 --> 09:55.720
What did you say?

10:01.630 --> 10:02.310
Brother.

10:04.400 --> 10:06.130
What else can I do for you?

10:06.790 --> 10:07.520
Consider it

10:08.440 --> 10:10.300
as me doing something for Father.

10:10.510 --> 10:11.200
If that's the case,

10:11.200 --> 10:13.000
I need you to do something for me.

10:13.920 --> 10:15.520
Go and reclaim the command of

10:16.270 --> 10:17.750
the Imperial Guards from

10:17.750 --> 10:18.810
the Murong family.

10:19.870 --> 10:20.470
All right.

10:21.910 --> 10:22.710
I promise you.

10:27.400 --> 10:29.930
Her Majesty the Empress Dowager
has arrived.

10:39.870 --> 10:40.800
Everyone leave.

10:41.030 --> 10:41.480
Yes.

10:52.480 --> 10:53.030
Mother.

10:55.720 --> 10:57.200
You left the palace last night.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.210
Where did you go?

10:59.110 --> 11:00.440
I was feeling troubled,

11:00.970 --> 11:02.630
so I wanted to go out for a walk.

11:04.520 --> 11:05.980
You still dare to lie to me?

11:06.080 --> 11:07.110
I'm the Emperor!

11:07.790 --> 11:09.070
I go wherever I want!

11:09.150 --> 11:10.810
So now you realize who you are?

11:11.490 --> 11:13.390
Now you know you're the Emperor?

11:13.790 --> 11:15.270
Even if you're the Emperor,

11:15.270 --> 11:16.870
you'll always be my son!

11:17.320 --> 11:19.380
I'm the one who put you on that throne.

11:19.480 --> 11:20.320
Is this imperial arrogance you're showing

11:20.320 --> 11:21.910
meant for me?

11:22.360 --> 11:23.420
Then I might as well

11:24.120 --> 11:24.960
give up this throne.

11:24.960 --> 11:26.020
You wouldn't dare!

11:26.910 --> 11:28.640
Mother, you came to see me today

11:29.440 --> 11:30.630
because you already knew

11:30.630 --> 11:31.480
where I went

11:31.720 --> 11:32.520
and whom I met.

11:32.910 --> 11:34.490
So why bother asking me?

11:36.670 --> 11:37.290
Tell me.

11:38.200 --> 11:40.260
What exactly did Feng Suige tell you?

11:40.320 --> 11:41.360
What sweet lies did he use

11:41.360 --> 11:42.220
to beguile you?

11:42.790 --> 11:44.610
Brother didn't beguile me.

11:45.550 --> 11:47.190
He told me the truth.

11:48.320 --> 11:50.380
You're still calling him "Brother"?

11:50.750 --> 11:52.030
You'd rather believe his nonsense

11:52.030 --> 11:53.260
than believe me?

11:53.630 --> 11:55.110
I am your mother.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.360
I'm the only family you have left

11:56.360 --> 11:57.520
in this world!

11:57.670 --> 11:58.870
That's exactly why I can't let you

11:58.870 --> 12:00.130
keep making mistakes!

12:01.120 --> 12:01.790
Mother,

12:02.510 --> 12:03.480
please wake up.

12:04.390 --> 12:06.270
Don't stay lost in your delusions,

12:06.270 --> 12:08.530
and don't keep making the same mistakes.

12:10.350 --> 12:11.480
Listen to yourself.

12:11.480 --> 12:13.810
What nonsense are you even talking about?

12:15.030 --> 12:15.960
I can still tell

12:15.960 --> 12:17.000
right from wrong.

12:17.910 --> 12:18.840
I have never been

12:20.000 --> 12:22.060
this clear-headed in my entire life.

12:22.440 --> 12:23.120
Mother,

12:24.360 --> 12:25.600
I beg you.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.240
Please turn back.

12:28.030 --> 12:29.080
You know, Grandfather's last words

12:29.080 --> 12:30.750
were for me

12:31.960 --> 12:34.320
to take good care of you.

12:35.480 --> 12:36.480
I don't want to see you

12:36.480 --> 12:38.080
keep making the same mistakes.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.000
I don't want to see you

12:39.000 --> 12:40.670
become what you are now.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.120
Brother is still alive.

12:43.360 --> 12:45.420
We still have a chance to make amends.

12:45.780 --> 12:47.910
Anyone in this world can say I'm wrong—

12:48.510 --> 12:49.840
anyone but you!

12:50.510 --> 12:51.990
Everything I've done

12:52.670 --> 12:54.200
has been for you.

12:57.720 --> 12:58.320
Mother.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.390
I've made my decision.

13:02.940 --> 13:05.150
I'll issue an edict to strip Murong Yao

13:05.600 --> 13:08.000
of his position as
the Imperial Guards' Commander-in-Chief.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.400
Even if you try to stop me,

13:10.150 --> 13:11.200
I'll still do it.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.890
I was wrong indeed.

13:17.390 --> 13:19.010
My mistake was

13:19.610 --> 13:20.880
spoiling you too much.

13:21.840 --> 13:24.770
You're not yet ready to bear
the weight of an emperor.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.520
I was too hasty.

13:28.550 --> 13:29.680
From this moment on,

13:30.510 --> 13:32.390
you'll remain in the palace
to reflect on your mistakes.

13:32.390 --> 13:34.200
You're not to take a single step outside.

13:34.200 --> 13:36.200
I will handle court affairs in your stead,

13:36.200 --> 13:37.480
and matters of state
will be decided by me.

13:37.480 --> 13:38.410
The rest can wait

13:39.200 --> 13:41.800
until you've truly reflected on
your actions.

14:06.040 --> 14:08.310
[May the Noble Spirit Endure]

14:08.360 --> 14:11.900
[Embrace Simplicity and Uphold Truth]

14:13.240 --> 14:13.730
Father,

14:14.030 --> 14:15.160
where are you going?

14:15.480 --> 14:16.940
Have you found Feng Suige?

14:21.540 --> 14:23.760
Feng Suige is now isolated and weak.

14:24.360 --> 14:26.050
If he wants to compete against us,

14:26.050 --> 14:29.210
[Embrace Simplicity and Uphold Truth]

14:26.270 --> 14:27.240
the Feng Battalion

14:27.240 --> 14:27.870
is the only power

14:27.870 --> 14:28.930
he can rely on.

14:29.480 --> 14:30.710
I've decided

14:31.480 --> 14:33.440
to go to the Feng Battalion
to personally take command.

14:33.440 --> 14:33.910
Father,

14:34.560 --> 14:35.590
I'll go with you.

14:36.750 --> 14:37.520
No need.

14:38.960 --> 14:41.270
You lead the Imperial Guards
and stay in the capital.

14:41.270 --> 14:43.030
As long as the capital stays secure

14:43.030 --> 14:45.080
and the Feng Battalion
is under my control,

14:45.080 --> 14:46.100
Feng Suige

14:46.750 --> 14:47.750
will sooner or later

14:47.750 --> 14:49.550
be trapped like a turtle in a jar.

14:50.260 --> 14:53.630
[Embrace Simplicity and Uphold Truth]

14:50.960 --> 14:51.600
Alright,

14:52.750 --> 14:53.950
don't worry too much.

14:54.070 --> 14:56.650
Everything is under my control.

14:57.060 --> 14:58.000
Feng Suige

14:58.750 --> 15:00.750
has no chance of turning the tables.

15:01.120 --> 15:02.120
Alright, Father.

15:02.210 --> 15:03.270
Please be careful.

15:09.370 --> 15:09.900
Let's go!

15:36.360 --> 15:37.560
Why did you summon me?

15:42.940 --> 15:44.080
You're the first person to ever see me

15:44.080 --> 15:45.680
draw a bow and shoot an arrow.

15:47.030 --> 15:48.030
What do you think?

15:48.550 --> 15:49.910
How does my heroic stance

15:49.910 --> 15:51.440
compare to your brother's?

15:54.400 --> 15:56.260
You can't even fully draw the bow.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.560
Are you even capable?

15:58.630 --> 16:00.760
I just don't care for weapon practice.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.330
If I were to lead troops,

16:02.960 --> 16:05.290
I'd certainly be an emperor on horseback.

16:13.440 --> 16:14.800
My brother taught me

16:15.200 --> 16:16.860
never to release an empty bow.

16:18.510 --> 16:20.710
It damages both the bow and the shooter.

16:20.720 --> 16:21.510
I know that.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.090
I just forgot for a moment.

16:24.390 --> 16:26.590
Why are you suddenly playing with a bow?

16:26.790 --> 16:27.720
To help you.

16:28.670 --> 16:29.150
Come on.

16:29.630 --> 16:30.760
Grind the ink for me.

16:31.510 --> 16:32.640
I'll draft an edict.

16:33.750 --> 16:34.570
Xia Jingyan,

16:35.200 --> 16:36.860
what exactly do you want to do?

16:39.670 --> 16:40.960
I'll proclaim myself

16:40.960 --> 16:42.760
the Grand Marshal of all forces.

16:43.990 --> 16:46.190
I'll take back all military authority,

16:46.440 --> 16:47.870
including the command over

16:47.870 --> 16:49.150
Xia Jingshi's Zhennan Army.

16:49.150 --> 16:51.120
Then, I'll personally
lead troops to Susha,

16:51.120 --> 16:53.440
deploy forces at the border
between our two kingdoms,

16:53.440 --> 16:55.550
and force the Murong father and sons
to show themselves.

16:55.550 --> 16:56.480
If you do this...

16:56.630 --> 16:57.490
Don't worry.

16:57.600 --> 16:58.440
As long as your brother is sensible,

16:58.440 --> 16:59.840
our kingdoms won't go to war.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.390
Your brother is the Emperor of Susha.

17:01.390 --> 17:01.960
His authority

17:01.960 --> 17:03.670
has been undermined
by the Murong father and sons.

17:03.670 --> 17:05.400
I'm sure he also wants to get rid of
the Murong family.

17:05.400 --> 17:07.130
I'll write him a secret letter.

17:07.640 --> 17:09.680
When the time comes,
I'll join forces with him

17:09.680 --> 17:11.859
to get rid of the Murong father and sons—

17:11.859 --> 17:13.440
kill two birds with one stone,

17:13.440 --> 17:14.650
a win-win.

17:15.619 --> 17:17.819
I'm afraid your thinking's too simple.

17:18.270 --> 17:18.920
Xia Jingshi

17:18.920 --> 17:21.720
would never give up his command,
not even in death.

17:21.960 --> 17:23.640
Then I'm really looking forward to seeing

17:23.640 --> 17:26.040
if he has the guts
to defy my imperial order.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.640
Alright, stop dawdling.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.770
Grind the ink for me.

17:48.770 --> 17:49.960
Who's there? Halt!

17:56.200 --> 17:57.000
His Highness.

17:57.200 --> 17:58.260
It's His Highness!

17:59.590 --> 18:00.450
Your Highness.

18:00.880 --> 18:02.010
You're still alive?

18:04.920 --> 18:05.480
It's me.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.540
Sorry to keep you all waiting.

18:22.510 --> 18:23.830
Let him in! Quick, open the gate!

18:23.830 --> 18:25.030
Open the gate! Hurry!

18:44.330 --> 18:45.280
Feng Suige?

18:45.600 --> 18:46.530
You're not dead?

19:05.350 --> 19:05.750
It's General.

19:05.750 --> 19:06.480
General is back.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.400
General is back.

19:07.400 --> 19:08.350
General has returned.

19:08.350 --> 19:09.550
-General.
-General.

19:09.680 --> 19:11.140
-General.
-It's General.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.720
This man is a wanted criminal
of the imperial court.

19:15.720 --> 19:16.570
Generals,

19:16.720 --> 19:18.200
seize him at once!

19:22.750 --> 19:24.310
Are you trying to rebel?

19:24.440 --> 19:25.850
Feng Suige committed
regicide and patricide!

19:25.850 --> 19:26.880
His crimes are unforgivable!

19:26.880 --> 19:28.540
Arrest him at once!

19:28.590 --> 19:29.710
He's right.

19:30.110 --> 19:30.710
Right now,

19:31.270 --> 19:33.200
I'm a fugitive wanted by the court.

19:33.240 --> 19:35.770
But I never committed
regicide or patricide.

19:38.310 --> 19:39.310
I came back today

19:40.100 --> 19:42.170
to clear my name.

19:42.960 --> 19:44.760
Brothers of the Feng Battalion!

19:45.110 --> 19:47.480
I don't want to
make things difficult for you.

19:47.480 --> 19:50.340
If any of you want to win merit
by capturing me today,

19:51.070 --> 19:52.930
don't hesitate and step forward.

20:08.680 --> 20:10.460
Did you all hear that?

20:11.340 --> 20:13.060
He just admitted it himself!

20:13.300 --> 20:14.540
Seize him now!

20:18.930 --> 20:19.840
What are you waiting for?

20:19.840 --> 20:20.930
Take him down!

20:21.310 --> 20:22.060
Today,

20:22.240 --> 20:24.180
whoever captures Feng Suige

20:24.310 --> 20:25.360
will be promoted 3 ranks

20:25.360 --> 20:26.960
and rewarded with 100 taels of gold!

20:26.960 --> 20:29.210
If anyone dares to harbor him,

20:29.270 --> 20:30.680
they'll be treated as accomplices!

20:30.680 --> 20:31.680
The crime of rebellion

20:31.680 --> 20:33.240
will lead to the execution of
your entire clan!

20:33.240 --> 20:35.640
-Think about your family!
-Your Highness!

20:36.640 --> 20:37.000
You...

20:37.000 --> 20:37.510
Cao.

20:39.110 --> 20:39.880
What happened to your leg?

20:39.880 --> 20:40.590
It's nothing.

20:40.590 --> 20:42.140
Those bastards broke it.

20:42.410 --> 20:43.120
I

20:43.150 --> 20:45.230
can't follow Your Highness
to battle anymore,

20:45.230 --> 20:46.760
but I can still cook for you.

20:47.000 --> 20:47.860
Your Highness,

20:48.360 --> 20:49.950
you won't mind having me around, will you?

20:49.950 --> 20:51.210
How could I ever mind?

20:51.750 --> 20:52.810
Where is Hong Shan?

20:54.190 --> 20:55.210
That poor fellow

20:55.440 --> 20:56.570
has gone ahead of us.

20:56.640 --> 20:59.240
He asked me to wait for
Your Highness's return.

21:00.590 --> 21:01.620
It's all my fault.

21:02.750 --> 21:04.020
I came back too late.

21:14.440 --> 21:15.900
Honor heaven above,

21:16.310 --> 21:17.930
respect the earth below!

21:18.110 --> 21:19.880
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

21:19.880 --> 21:21.510
and never fail the people!

21:22.280 --> 21:22.700
You...

21:29.550 --> 21:31.080
Honor heaven above,

21:31.310 --> 21:32.910
respect the earth below!

21:33.070 --> 21:34.830
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

21:34.830 --> 21:36.490
and never fail the people!

21:36.590 --> 21:38.270
Honor heaven above,

21:38.440 --> 21:40.010
respect the earth below!

21:40.200 --> 21:41.880
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

21:41.880 --> 21:43.460
and never fail the people!

21:43.600 --> 21:44.200
All of you,

21:44.400 --> 21:45.610
shut up!

21:45.640 --> 21:46.530
Get up!

21:47.400 --> 21:48.690
Get up right now!

21:49.240 --> 21:49.830
You...

21:50.200 --> 21:51.160
All of you!

21:52.290 --> 21:54.310
The government pays your salaries!

21:54.510 --> 21:56.550
You're not Feng Suige's private army!

21:56.550 --> 21:57.510
Let me tell you,

21:57.790 --> 21:59.430
if you arrest Feng Suige now,

21:59.460 --> 22:00.460
it's not too late!

22:00.830 --> 22:01.400
The Prince of Han

22:01.400 --> 22:02.930
is on his way here right now!

22:03.240 --> 22:04.960
If you dare to delay any longer,

22:04.960 --> 22:05.790
once His Highness arrives,

22:05.790 --> 22:06.510
he'll surely make you

22:06.510 --> 22:07.970
die alongside Feng Suige!

22:12.920 --> 22:13.980
What are you doing?

22:14.720 --> 22:16.310
-Beat him to death!
-Beat him to death!

22:16.310 --> 22:17.310
Beat him to death!

22:20.720 --> 22:21.920
-Beat him!
-Beat him!

22:27.580 --> 22:29.580
Although I, Feng Suige, am a prince,

22:30.110 --> 22:32.240
I've been displaced since childhood.

22:33.720 --> 22:35.920
It wasn't until
I founded the Feng Battalion

22:35.920 --> 22:37.450
that I finally found a home.

22:37.590 --> 22:38.960
You're all my family.

22:46.630 --> 22:47.420
Guys.

22:47.880 --> 22:48.480
Over the years,

22:48.480 --> 22:50.270
we've fought off foreign enemies together,

22:50.270 --> 22:51.350
risking our lives

22:51.750 --> 22:52.880
for Susha,

22:53.480 --> 22:54.160
never showing

22:54.160 --> 22:56.020
the slightest bit of negligence.

22:56.790 --> 22:57.890
Yet now,

22:58.110 --> 22:58.960
I've been accused of

22:58.960 --> 23:00.540
regicide and patricide.

23:01.110 --> 23:02.000
It was me who led you all

23:02.000 --> 23:03.530
down this path of no return.

23:03.790 --> 23:05.590
I'm sorry to have made you suffer!

23:05.590 --> 23:06.190
Not at all!

23:06.240 --> 23:06.830
We don't mind.

23:06.830 --> 23:07.550
We don't mind at all!

23:07.550 --> 23:09.640
Not at all!

23:09.640 --> 23:11.700
If anyone wants to leave now,

23:12.110 --> 23:13.750
I, Feng Suige, will not force them
to stay.

23:13.750 --> 23:15.960
I won't stop you,
nor will I hold any grudge.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.560
Whatever I do from here on out

23:18.160 --> 23:20.760
will have nothing to do with
any of you present!

23:21.590 --> 23:23.240
Is there anyone who wishes to leave?

23:23.240 --> 23:24.070
No one!

23:24.510 --> 23:26.240
Now is not the time to play hero.

23:26.400 --> 23:27.800
It's not too late to quit!

23:28.790 --> 23:30.360
Our fates

23:30.590 --> 23:32.070
rise and fall together!

23:32.350 --> 23:33.810
Live together in joy,

23:34.110 --> 23:35.810
die together in hardship!

23:46.880 --> 23:47.510
Guys.

23:47.930 --> 23:49.030
Today, I also want to

23:49.030 --> 23:50.490
introduce someone to you.

23:58.510 --> 23:59.710
Her name is Fu Yixiao.

24:00.720 --> 24:01.920
She was once Jinxiu's

24:01.920 --> 24:02.980
Red-Clad General.

24:03.210 --> 24:04.280
But now, she has

24:04.310 --> 24:06.000
nothing to do with Jinxiu anymore.

24:06.000 --> 24:06.680
My life

24:07.830 --> 24:09.080
was saved by her.

24:11.960 --> 24:13.420
She not only saved my life.

24:14.640 --> 24:16.500
When I was falling into the abyss,

24:17.350 --> 24:18.410
she pulled me back;

24:18.720 --> 24:20.320
when I was sinking into hell,

24:20.790 --> 24:21.960
she awakened me.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.070
Without Fu Yixiao,

24:25.440 --> 24:26.400
there wouldn't be the Feng Suige

24:26.400 --> 24:27.690
you see today!

24:33.400 --> 24:34.030
Guys.

24:35.440 --> 24:36.570
What I want to say is,

24:37.160 --> 24:37.820
from now on,

24:38.400 --> 24:41.000
I'll stand by Fu Yixiao
through thick and thin,

24:41.270 --> 24:42.930
never abandoning each other.

24:45.120 --> 24:46.380
From this day forward,

24:46.590 --> 24:48.350
she's one of our Feng Battalion.

24:48.350 --> 24:48.790
She

24:50.000 --> 24:51.510
is our family!

24:53.550 --> 24:55.790
Fu Yixiao! Fu Yixiao!

24:55.880 --> 24:57.790
Fu Yixiao! Fu Yixiao!

24:57.960 --> 25:00.000
Fu Yixiao! Fu Yixiao!

25:00.070 --> 25:02.110
Fu Yixiao! Fu Yixiao!

25:02.240 --> 25:04.240
Fu Yixiao! Fu Yixiao!

25:04.350 --> 25:06.510
Fu Yixiao! Fu Yixiao!

25:06.550 --> 25:07.590
Fu Yixiao!

25:10.400 --> 25:11.120
Guys!

25:11.480 --> 25:13.920
Murong Zhong will be here any moment.

25:14.820 --> 25:16.550
Let's get our defenses in place

25:16.550 --> 25:18.070
and prepare to face the enemy!

25:18.070 --> 25:18.830
Yes!

26:28.110 --> 26:29.240
An enemy is an enemy.

26:29.970 --> 26:32.200
Next time, don't put on
that sanctimonious act,

26:32.200 --> 26:34.400
pretending to persuade me to turn back.

26:34.640 --> 26:35.920
You just think killing me

26:35.920 --> 26:37.780
would interfere with your plans.

26:38.310 --> 26:39.360
Xia Jingshi.

26:39.830 --> 26:40.790
No one in this world

26:40.790 --> 26:42.720
understands what you're thinking

26:43.480 --> 26:45.510
right now better than I do.

26:47.060 --> 26:48.160
Xia Jingshi!

26:48.240 --> 26:49.500
I'll kill you!

27:03.860 --> 27:06.120
Your Highness, Her Majesty has arrived.

27:06.940 --> 27:07.800
Your Highness.

27:08.830 --> 27:10.490
Your Highness, what's wrong?

27:10.640 --> 27:11.790
Is the poison acting up again?

27:11.790 --> 27:13.920
Help me deal with Her Majesty
for a bit.

27:26.000 --> 27:26.600
Greetings

27:28.370 --> 27:29.440
to you, Mother.

27:30.190 --> 27:31.450
What's wrong with you?

27:31.830 --> 27:32.750
Your Majesty.

27:33.270 --> 27:35.550
His Highness is suffering from
the effects of the poison.

27:35.550 --> 27:36.590
Didn't I give you

27:36.590 --> 27:37.990
the antidote last month?

27:38.240 --> 27:39.700
Did you not take it on time?

27:39.920 --> 27:41.750
His Highness did take the antidote,

27:41.750 --> 27:43.080
but these past few days,

27:43.200 --> 27:44.510
His Highness has been feeling restless,

27:44.510 --> 27:46.200
utterly exhausted in body and mind.

27:46.200 --> 27:46.880
It's probably because

27:46.880 --> 27:47.960
his body is too weak

27:48.480 --> 27:50.480
that the poison has flared up again.

27:53.510 --> 27:54.570
Prince of Zhennan.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.640
You're not hiding

27:56.640 --> 27:58.170
something from me, are you?

28:01.000 --> 28:01.650
Mother,

28:03.070 --> 28:03.880
I'm not.

28:04.720 --> 28:07.030
I don't want to make you worry, Mother.

28:08.310 --> 28:09.570
It's nothing serious.

28:10.160 --> 28:12.240
Since you've taken the antidote on time,

28:12.240 --> 28:13.700
your life's not in danger.

28:14.480 --> 28:15.410
Get up and speak.

28:16.070 --> 28:16.550
Yes.

28:21.170 --> 28:23.230
If you can't endure this little pain,

28:23.810 --> 28:25.070
how will you command the army

28:25.070 --> 28:26.470
in my stead in the future?

28:40.830 --> 28:42.290
You speak wisely, Mother.

28:43.550 --> 28:44.750
I heard His Majesty took you

28:44.750 --> 28:46.200
to that wretched woman,

28:46.830 --> 28:48.760
and Feng Xiyang almost killed you,

28:48.830 --> 28:50.160
so I came to check on you.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.510
Why didn't you tell me

28:51.750 --> 28:53.350
about such a serious matter?

28:53.750 --> 28:55.950
I didn't want to make you worry, Mother,

28:56.270 --> 28:57.600
so I kept quiet about it.

28:59.380 --> 29:00.350
Your health

29:00.350 --> 29:01.950
is deteriorating day by day.

29:03.070 --> 29:05.600
This Rongyang Palace
is gloomy and confined,

29:05.680 --> 29:07.280
not suitable for long stays.

29:07.720 --> 29:08.310
I think

29:08.790 --> 29:10.650
you should move out of the palace.

29:15.720 --> 29:16.880
Mother, do you mean

29:18.030 --> 29:19.760
you want me to leave the palace?

29:19.960 --> 29:22.090
His Majesty didn't kill you this time,

29:22.270 --> 29:23.070
but there's no guarantee

29:23.070 --> 29:24.730
he won't be serious next time.

29:24.790 --> 29:25.680
Now in this palace,

29:25.680 --> 29:27.880
even I find it difficult to protect you.

29:28.160 --> 29:30.620
You'd better go outside
and hide for a while.

29:30.920 --> 29:33.100
I've arranged a residence in the city.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.440
Go and stay there.

29:38.590 --> 29:39.390
Don't forget,

29:40.240 --> 29:41.970
you were the one who reminded me

29:42.590 --> 29:44.720
the Qianqiu Festival is approaching.

29:45.200 --> 29:47.130
You should start preparing early.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.270
Thank you for your kindness, Mother.

29:53.270 --> 29:54.160
I understand.

29:55.110 --> 29:56.670
And I know what to do.

29:57.000 --> 29:59.060
Don't disappoint me again this time.

30:07.920 --> 30:08.780
Your Highness!

30:11.200 --> 30:12.000
The antidote.

30:12.920 --> 30:14.120
Give me the antidote.

30:14.270 --> 30:14.680
Yes.

30:22.880 --> 30:24.110
I said before

30:25.200 --> 30:26.070
that these antidotes must not be touched

30:26.070 --> 30:27.670
until the grand plan begins.

30:31.310 --> 30:31.960
And now,

30:34.350 --> 30:36.150
the grand plan is about to begin.

32:42.370 --> 32:43.640
Feng Suige...

32:44.110 --> 32:45.550
Uncle Murong.

32:47.750 --> 32:49.220
We meet again.

32:50.310 --> 32:51.770
So you really aren't dead.

32:52.200 --> 32:54.200
With my great vengeance unavenged,

32:54.240 --> 32:55.880
how would I dare to die first?

33:05.580 --> 33:06.510
There's no rush.

33:07.550 --> 33:09.210
I still have things to ask you.

33:10.030 --> 33:11.630
There's nothing left to say.

33:11.750 --> 33:13.000
Kill him!

33:40.640 --> 33:41.980
You once saved my life.

33:43.140 --> 33:45.690
I regarded you as my closest elder.

33:47.270 --> 33:49.650
Why did you kill my father?

33:50.680 --> 33:53.380
Why did you want me dead as well?

33:53.920 --> 33:54.720
If you hadn't,

33:56.160 --> 33:57.820
then Yao would have had to die.

33:58.040 --> 33:58.970
I begged you,

34:00.250 --> 34:01.510
but you turned me down.

34:02.590 --> 34:04.290
You wouldn't help me save Yao.

34:05.110 --> 34:07.170
I carried thorny branches on my back,

34:07.510 --> 34:10.460
kowtowing with every step into the palace,

34:11.070 --> 34:12.480
to beg your father

34:12.510 --> 34:13.860
to spare his life.

34:14.360 --> 34:17.070
But he still wouldn't let Yao go.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.710
I couldn't just watch

34:20.710 --> 34:23.230
my son die.

34:24.440 --> 34:25.820
Yao and I

34:26.550 --> 34:28.000
had no way out.

34:29.510 --> 34:30.400
This was all

34:31.690 --> 34:34.360
forced upon us by you and your father.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.580
If it hadn't been for Murong Yao's

34:37.920 --> 34:39.800
treason and collusion with the enemy,

34:39.800 --> 34:41.230
so many Susha soldiers

34:41.230 --> 34:42.400
wouldn't have died unjustly

34:42.400 --> 34:43.860
in the Battle of Pingling!

34:51.110 --> 34:52.360
He betrayed me.

34:53.760 --> 34:55.100
I could spare his life,

34:56.510 --> 34:58.110
but how am I supposed to answer to

34:58.110 --> 35:00.170
all our brothers who died?

35:07.240 --> 35:08.340
Talking about

35:08.400 --> 35:10.070
brotherhood in front of me?

35:15.400 --> 35:16.490
In this life,

35:18.960 --> 35:20.050
how many battles

35:21.430 --> 35:22.420
have Yao and I

35:23.070 --> 35:24.760
fought for

35:26.180 --> 35:27.910
you and your father's kingdom?

35:28.770 --> 35:31.300
I was even like a brother to His Majesty.

35:32.030 --> 35:33.360
It's fair to say I've spent my entire life

35:33.360 --> 35:34.960
laying down my life for him!

35:36.490 --> 35:37.580
Look at me!

35:38.630 --> 35:39.920
I've done far more for Susha

35:39.920 --> 35:41.320
than you ever have.

35:42.360 --> 35:44.040
All that talk of patriotism

35:44.630 --> 35:46.070
is nothing

35:46.670 --> 35:48.550
but a joke to me now!

35:49.390 --> 35:50.280
In my life,

35:51.070 --> 35:52.330
I've never sought fame

35:53.400 --> 35:54.850
or power.

35:55.760 --> 35:57.000
All I wanted

35:57.800 --> 36:00.290
was to live peacefully

36:00.400 --> 36:02.710
with my children and grandchildren.

36:04.480 --> 36:06.550
Is that too much to ask?

36:09.030 --> 36:10.150
Is that a crime?

36:16.110 --> 36:16.960
Your father

36:18.480 --> 36:19.760
deserved to die,

36:32.880 --> 36:33.920
and so do you.

36:38.370 --> 36:39.590
I must save Yao.

36:41.800 --> 36:43.290
I must save Yao!

36:48.280 --> 36:49.760
I must save Yao.

37:36.360 --> 37:37.150
Suige,

37:38.360 --> 37:39.910
please spare Yao.

37:41.190 --> 37:41.850
Killing you

37:43.060 --> 37:44.660
was my idea.

37:45.670 --> 37:47.330
He was forced into it.

37:48.510 --> 37:50.230
You may pulverize my bones

37:51.230 --> 37:52.880
and scatter my ashes.

37:53.660 --> 37:54.720
I only beg you

37:56.590 --> 37:57.840
to spare Yao...

38:07.110 --> 38:08.290
Uncle Murong.

38:10.920 --> 38:12.720
His Majesty never intended

38:12.760 --> 38:14.330
to harm you and Yao.

38:22.550 --> 38:23.170
That day,

38:24.800 --> 38:26.030
it was Empress Zhuang

38:27.150 --> 38:28.960
who killed His Majesty.

39:01.110 --> 39:03.400
The Murong family has brought chaos
to our kingdom

39:03.400 --> 39:04.730
and committed treason.

39:05.630 --> 39:06.800
Their crimes are grave,

39:06.800 --> 39:08.660
intolerable to heaven and earth.

39:09.070 --> 39:10.800
All soldiers, heed my command!

39:10.840 --> 39:11.590
Yes!

39:13.190 --> 39:14.850
March with me into Yujing City

39:17.190 --> 39:18.990
to avenge His Majesty!

39:19.280 --> 39:20.150
Yes!

39:31.110 --> 39:32.720
My mistake

39:33.240 --> 39:34.700
was spoiling you too much.

39:35.440 --> 39:37.900
You're not yet ready to bear
the weight of an emperor.

39:37.900 --> 39:39.210
I was too hasty.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.650
From this moment on,

39:41.760 --> 39:43.760
you'll remain in the palace
to reflect on your mistakes.

39:43.760 --> 39:46.020
You're not to take a single step outside.

39:46.330 --> 39:47.470
Spare my mother.

39:48.480 --> 39:50.140
I'll take her away from Yujing

39:50.150 --> 39:51.880
to live out our remaining days.

39:51.920 --> 39:52.710
Her sins

39:52.710 --> 39:53.880
are also my sins.

39:55.670 --> 39:57.330
I'll pay for them in her place.

39:58.710 --> 39:59.360
Someone!

40:01.440 --> 40:02.400
Summon the Keeper of the Imperial Seal

40:02.400 --> 40:03.920
to bring the Imperial Seal.

40:03.920 --> 40:05.250
I need to draft an edict.

40:06.880 --> 40:08.110
I'm speaking to you.

40:08.150 --> 40:09.170
Can't you hear me?

40:09.670 --> 40:11.130
Are you defying my orders?

40:12.000 --> 40:12.800
Your Majesty.

40:13.280 --> 40:13.990
Her Majesty...

40:13.990 --> 40:15.520
The Empress Dowager's words are orders,

40:15.520 --> 40:16.960
and mine aren't?

40:17.710 --> 40:19.070
I am the Emperor.

40:19.230 --> 40:19.760
My words—

40:19.760 --> 40:22.360
every single word I utter
is an imperial edict!

40:23.670 --> 40:25.530
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

40:33.940 --> 40:35.800
I will say this one last time.

40:36.400 --> 40:39.070
Summon the Keeper of the Imperial Seal
to bring the Imperial Seal.

40:39.070 --> 40:40.480
I need to draft an edict!

40:43.000 --> 40:44.930
If these ears of yours cannot hear,

40:45.710 --> 40:47.110
I'll cut them off for you!

40:53.900 --> 40:55.700
Who let the Prince of Zhennan go?

41:01.060 --> 41:02.030
Was it you?

41:02.920 --> 41:03.820
Spare me, Your Majesty!

41:03.820 --> 41:05.570
I know nothing about it!

41:09.020 --> 41:10.080
He glanced at you.

41:10.180 --> 41:11.110
So it must be you.

41:11.110 --> 41:12.360
It wasn't me, Your Majesty.

41:12.360 --> 41:13.480
Spare me, Your Majesty!

41:13.480 --> 41:14.800
It was me who let him go.

41:20.000 --> 41:21.000
All of you, leave!

41:27.760 --> 41:29.400
Mother, what's that supposed to mean?

41:29.400 --> 41:30.930
I should be asking you.

41:31.800 --> 41:33.670
You intend to reclaim all military power.

41:33.670 --> 41:35.330
What's that supposed to mean?

41:40.670 --> 41:43.150
Mother, you truly have eyes and ears
everywhere.

41:43.150 --> 41:45.400
My edict just reached the Secretariat,

41:45.590 --> 41:47.150
and you're already alarmed.

41:47.150 --> 41:47.590
Do you realize

41:47.590 --> 41:48.850
how much trouble

41:48.920 --> 41:50.670
issuing this imperial edict will cause?

41:50.670 --> 41:52.510
Which of those veteran generals,
so used to wielding their own troops,

41:52.510 --> 41:53.970
will let it slide quietly?

41:54.230 --> 41:56.280
Even if the sky fell on Jinxiu,

41:57.920 --> 41:59.850
it should be me bearing the weight.

42:00.690 --> 42:01.690
I understand now.

42:02.370 --> 42:03.360
In your heart,

42:03.880 --> 42:05.480
the one who holds up

42:05.480 --> 42:07.070
the sky over Jinxiu has never been me,

42:07.070 --> 42:08.600
but Xia Jingshi. Am I right?

42:08.670 --> 42:09.840
He did hold it up.

42:10.550 --> 42:11.550
If it weren't for him,

42:11.550 --> 42:12.550
Susha's army

42:12.550 --> 42:14.070
would have reached here long ago!

42:14.070 --> 42:16.530
Even without Xia Jingshi,
there's still me!

42:16.630 --> 42:17.590
Look at

42:17.590 --> 42:18.920
what you've become now.

42:19.320 --> 42:20.360
How exactly

42:20.360 --> 42:20.840
did that wretched Feng Xiyang

42:20.840 --> 42:21.880
bewitch you?

42:21.880 --> 42:23.280
Don't call her wretched!

42:25.590 --> 42:26.230
You think I'm

42:26.230 --> 42:27.630
bewitched by her beauty?

42:27.760 --> 42:29.000
I've seen all kinds of women, okay?

42:29.000 --> 42:30.590
Then why do you protect her so fiercely?

42:30.590 --> 42:31.440
Because she gave me

42:31.440 --> 42:33.000
something I've never had before.

42:33.000 --> 42:33.800
When she was most helpless,

42:33.800 --> 42:36.060
she asked for my help. Do you understand?

42:39.710 --> 42:41.710
Of course you wouldn't understand.

42:41.710 --> 42:42.500
In your eyes,

42:43.000 --> 42:44.280
I'm nothing but someone who

42:44.280 --> 42:46.010
wastes his life in debauchery.

42:46.590 --> 42:48.250
I only ascended to this throne

42:48.360 --> 42:49.710
because I am your son.

42:55.150 --> 42:56.440
Have you ever for one day

42:56.440 --> 42:57.300
cared about me?

43:03.550 --> 43:04.880
Everyone in the world thinks

43:04.880 --> 43:05.720
I'm useless.

43:06.320 --> 43:07.000
After a while,

43:07.000 --> 43:08.530
I started to believe it too.

43:08.800 --> 43:10.660
I once wanted to be a good emperor,

43:11.030 --> 43:12.490
but no one believed in me,

43:12.800 --> 43:14.660
and no one had expectations of me.

43:14.760 --> 43:17.020
Then what's the point of working so hard?

43:18.040 --> 43:20.500
You've always been
the true ruler of Jinxiu.

43:20.770 --> 43:22.570
So I could only give up on myself.

43:24.440 --> 43:26.240
But Feng Xiyang doesn't think like that.

43:26.240 --> 43:27.690
She thinks I have value.

43:27.850 --> 43:29.030
She's never

43:29.030 --> 43:30.070
tried to bewitch me.

43:30.070 --> 43:30.480
She's never even

43:30.480 --> 43:31.710
treated me kindly.

43:32.550 --> 43:33.630
But when she was most desperate

43:33.630 --> 43:34.510
and most helpless,

43:34.510 --> 43:36.510
she asked me to help her get revenge.

43:39.930 --> 43:41.330
Do you find me ridiculous

43:42.920 --> 43:43.580
or pitiful?

43:44.760 --> 43:45.980
But I don't think so.

43:48.670 --> 43:49.590
I like this feeling

43:49.590 --> 43:50.760
of being needed.

43:57.360 --> 43:58.590
Because I have never

43:58.590 --> 43:59.720
been needed before.

44:00.590 --> 44:01.550
All of this...

44:03.480 --> 44:05.400
All of this was because of you,

44:05.400 --> 44:06.190
Mother!
